An '''Earl''' (Japanese: '''アール''' ''Earl'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in [[Generation VI]]. This Trainer class is a title of nobility, granted in the [[Battle Chateau]], and Trainers with this class only appear there. Earl is the third rank of nobility for males, ranking above {{tc|Viscount}} and below {{tc|Marquis}}. Its counterpart for females is {{tc|Countess}}.

The male [[player character]] may earn the title of Earl by winning enough {{pkmn|battle}}s in the Battle Chateau. All opponent Earls use parties of two Pokémon at level 25 (if no Writ of Challenge is active).

